---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Dashboard from '../components/Dashboard.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';import {features} from '../data/content';
---
<Layout title="Vending management platform" description="Explore VendBI’s approach to vending operations, inventory and business intelligence. Confirm hardware support and capabilities in a personalised demo."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">THE VENDBI PLATFORM</p><h1>Your fleet.<br/>A clearer perspective.</h1><p>Connect the questions that matter across your vending business: what’s selling, what needs attention and where to focus next.</p><a class="btn" href="/book-demo/">Explore in a Demo ↗</a></div></section><section class="section pt-0"><div class="container"><Dashboard/></div></section><section class="section soft-bg"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><h2>One business.<br/>Connected conversations.</h2><p>Use a demo to assess these areas against your real operating needs. Exact features, timing and supported hardware require confirmation.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">{features.map(f=><div class="feature-card"><span class="icon-box"><Icon name={f.icon}/></span><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.text}</p><p class="small-note">{f.detail}</p></div>)}</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMPATIBILITY COMES FIRST</p><h2>A setup that fits<br/>your operation.</h2></div><div><p>There is no universal hardware compatibility claim here. Before onboarding, share machine models, connection methods, current software and the workflows your team needs.</p><p>Remote actions, alerts, permissions and integrations should be validated against a supported-device and feature matrix.</p><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works/">See the onboarding approach ↗</a></div></div></section><CTA/></Layout>
